  <description>
    Photorealistic 3D model of McDonald's Guanxin Restaurant (麥當勞新竹關新店, 關新路 26 號).
    Features 2-story contemporary building with rectified real-photo PBR facade, iconic red blade wall with golden arches,
    15-meter independent roadside billboard pylon tower with Drive-Thru signage, dual drive-thru lanes with entry clearance pylon,
    ordering and pickup canopies, and outdoor customer parking lot with Tesla Destination Chargers.
  </description>
</model>
